# EdminBoost ANM Project Rules

WordPress admin notice management plugin. PHP 7.4+, WordPress 6.0+, GPL-3.0. Current release: **1.1.1**.

See `edminboost-anm-standards.mdc`, `edminboost-anm-compliance.mdc`, `edminboost-anm-wordpress-php.mdc`, `edminboost-anm-admin-assets.mdc`, `MONOREPO.md`.

## Directory Layout

```
